OL,3,GNEWSAMan struck by falling rocks
OL,4,Arescued from gill
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man struck by falling rocks was among
OL,7,Fa party of people rescued scrambling in
OL,8,Fa gill.
OL,10,FWasdale Mountain Rescue Team was called
OL,11,Fto Ill Gill, near Kirk Fell, after a
OL,12,Fman suffered head and hand injuries and
OL,13,Ftwo others were stuck in precarious
OL,14,Fpositions on Sunday at about 13:00 BST.
OL,16,FRichard Warren, Wasdale MRT Press
OL,17,FOfficer, said the scramble was "not one
OL,18,Fof the safest places" to climb, despite
OL,19,Fbeing "publicised in social media" and
OL,20,Fadded it was not the first time the
OL,21,Fteam had gone to the aid of injured
OL,22,Fpeople at the spot.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
