OL,3,GNEWSAMan struck by falling rocks
OL,4,Arescued from gill
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coastguard helicopter winched three
OL,7,Fpeople out of the gill, which was a
OL,8,F"particularly difficult location to
OL,9,Fextract a casualty on a stretcher",
OL,10,FWarren said.
